       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SWITCHES.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           UPSI-0 ON STATUS IS U0-ON OFF STATUS IS U0-OFF
           UPSI-3 IS SW3 OFF STATUS IS U3-OFF
           UPSI-5 IS SW5 ON STATUS IS U5-ON.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           IF U0-ON DISPLAY "U0 ON" ELSE DISPLAY "U0 NOT ON" END-IF
           IF U0-OFF DISPLAY "U0 OFF" END-IF
           IF NOT U3-OFF DISPLAY "U3 ON" ELSE DISPLAY "U3 OFF" END-IF
           IF U0-OFF AND U3-OFF DISPLAY "BOTH OFF" END-IF
           SET SW3 TO ON
           IF U3-OFF DISPLAY "U3 STILL OFF"
               ELSE DISPLAY "U3 NOW ON" END-IF
           SET SW3 TO OFF SW5 TO ON
           IF U3-OFF AND U5-ON DISPLAY "U3 OFF U5 ON" END-IF
           SET SW3 SW5 TO OFF
           IF NOT U5-ON DISPLAY "U5 OFF" END-IF
           STOP RUN.
